  [ do 4 right; left; reflexivity | lia | exact (proj2 HSPC1) | lia | lia | lia | intros a Ha; unfold PQARI1.ocell in Ha; lia
  | intros Ma Mb OW AG; apply (PQARI1.saves_agree sp R Ma Mb ltac:(lia) ltac:(lia) OW AG)
  | exact MS1 | exact MG1 | intros a Ha N; apply FRZ1; [exact Ha| intros X; apply N; lia]
