  - intros a Ha. kitx PQARIKX.callee_frame47 CF47; apply (CF47 (XB ++ mown s1 sa1) M1 M4 spc (PMSPA.pm_scr h) Wc HP4 ltac:(lia) WLO); clear CF47. exact Ha.
