  - intros a Ha Na. apply EK4. split; [lia|]. split.
    + apply (L5SAR.fframe_client L ar _ FF' spc (PMSPA.pm_scr h) F 4 (spc + 32)); [left; reflexivity| clear - Ha; lia].
    + intros rr Hin Hr. pose proof (WcR rr a Hin Hr) as X0. clear - X0 Na. lia.
